{
  "locale": "de",
  "title": {
    "de": "Ertragsvorhersage",
    "default": "Yield forecast"
  },
  "description": {
    "de": "Prognose deines PV-Ertrags",
    "default": "Forecast of your PV yield"
  },
  "calculatedValues": [
    {
      "name": "pvnode_v1",
      "expression": "{forecast} = 'pvnode' and {forecast_pvnode_site_id} empty"
    }
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "p_forecast_provider",
      "title": {
        "de": "Prognoseanbieter",
        "default": "Forecast provider"
      },
      "description": {
        "de": "Wähle den Dienst, der die Ertragsprognose für deine Anlage berechnet.",
        "default": "Choose the service that calculates the yield forecast for your system."
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "radiogroup",
          "name": "forecast",
          "title": {
            "de": "Welchen Prognosedienst möchtest du nutzen?",
            "default": "Which forecast service do you want to use?"
          },
          "description": {
            "de": "Alle Anbieter bieten sowohl kostenfreie als auch kostenpflichtige Tarife an.",
            "default": "All providers offer both free and paid tiers."
          },
          "isRequired": true,
          "defaultValue": "pvnode",
          "choices": [
            {
              "value": "pvnode",
              "text": {
                "de": "pvnode\n\n<a href=\"https://pvnode.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\">https://pvnode.com</a>",
                "default": "pvnode\n\n<a href=\"https://pvnode.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\">https://pvnode.com</a>"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "solcast",
              "text": {
                "de": "Solcast\n\n<a href=\"https://solcast.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\">https://solcast.com</a>",
                "default": "Solcast\n\n<a href=\"https://solcast.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\">https://solcast.com</a>"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "forecast.solar",
              "text": {
                "de": "Forecast.Solar\n\n<a href=\"https://forecast.solar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\">https://forecast.solar</a>",
                "default": "Forecast.Solar\n\n<a href=\"https://forecast.solar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\">https://forecast.solar</a>"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "p_pvnode",
      "visibleIf": "{forecast} = 'pvnode'",
      "title": {
        "de": "pvnode API",
        "default": "pvnode API"
      },
      "description": {
        "de": "Zugangsdaten für die pvnode-API.",
        "default": "Credentials for the pvnode API."
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "pvnode_apikey_link",
          "html": {
            "de": "<p>Den API-Key bekommst du unter <a href=\"https://pvnode.com/settings/api-keys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pvnode.com/settings/api-keys</a>.</p>",
            "default": "<p>You can get the API key at <a href=\"https://pvnode.com/settings/api-keys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pvnode.com/settings/api-keys</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "forecast_pvnode_apikey",
          "title": {
            "de": "API-Key",
            "default": "API key"
          },
          "isRequired": true
        },
        {
          "type": "radiogroup",
          "name": "forecast_pvnode_paid",
          "title": {
            "de": "pvnode-Tarif",
            "default": "pvnode plan"
          },
          "description": {
            "de": "Der Tarif muss zum aktiv abonnierten pvnode-Konto passen. Eine falsche Angabe kann Fehler oder vorzeitiges Aufbrauchen des monatlichen Kontingents verursachen.",
            "default": "The plan must match your active pvnode subscription. A mismatch can cause errors or exhaust the monthly quota prematurely."
          },
          "isRequired": true,
          "defaultValue": "false",
          "choices": [
            {
              "value": "false",
              "text": {
                "de": "Free",
                "default": "Free"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "true",
              "text": {
                "de": "Light",
                "default": "Light"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "nowcast",
              "text": {
                "de": "Plus",
                "default": "Plus"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "p_pvnode_site",
      "visibleIf": "{forecast} = 'pvnode'",
      "title": {
        "de": "pvnode Site (API v2)",
        "default": "pvnode site (API v2)"
      },
      "description": {
        "de": "Mit einer Site-ID nutzt der Collector die site-basierte pvnode-API v2. Standort und Dachflächen werden dann auf pvnode.com verwaltet und sind hier nicht mehr erforderlich.",
        "default": "With a site ID the collector uses the site-based pvnode API v2. Location and roofs are then managed on pvnode.com and are no longer needed here."
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "pvnode_v1_sunset",
          "html": {
            "de": "<p>Die klassische API v1 wird zum 31.12.2026 abgeschaltet. Alle Installationen sollten auf die API v2 wechseln.</p>",
            "default": "<p>The classic API v1 will be discontinued on 2026-12-31. All installations should switch to API v2.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "pvnode_site_docs",
          "html": {
            "de": "<p>Die API v2 ist site-basiert: Die Site wird unter <a href=\"https://pvnode.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pvnode.com</a> angelegt; dort werden Standort und alle Module konfiguriert. Ohne Site-ID verwendet der Collector weiterhin die API v1.</p>",
            "default": "<p>API v2 is site-based: the site is created at <a href=\"https://pvnode.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pvnode.com</a>, where location and all modules are configured. Without a site ID the collector keeps using API v1.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "forecast_pvnode_site_id",
          "title": {
            "de": "Site-ID",
            "default": "Site ID"
          },
          "description": {
            "de": "ID der Site aus dem pvnode-Konto. Solange leer, verwendet der Collector noch die klassische API v1.",
            "default": "ID of the site from the pvnode account. While empty, the collector still uses the classic API v1."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "p_forecast_solar_location",
      "visibleIf": "{forecast} = 'forecast.solar' or {pvnode_v1}",
      "title": {
        "de": "Standort",
        "default": "Location"
      },
      "description": {
        "de": "Die geografischen Koordinaten deiner PV-Anlage bestimmen Sonnenstand und Einstrahlung.",
        "default": "The geographic coordinates of your PV system determine sun position and irradiation."
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "forecast_latitude",
          "title": {
            "de": "Breitengrad",
            "default": "Latitude"
          },
          "description": {
            "de": "-90 (Süd) bis 90 (Nord)",
            "default": "-90 (South) to 90 (North)"
          },
          "isRequired": true,
          "inputType": "number",
          "min": -90,
          "max": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "forecast_longitude",
          "title": {
            "de": "Längengrad",
            "default": "Longitude"
          },
          "description": {
            "de": "-180 (West) bis 180 (Ost)",
            "default": "-180 (West) to 180 (East)"
          },
          "isRequired": true,
          "inputType": "number",
          "min": -180,
          "max": 180
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "p_forecast_roofs",
      "visibleIf": "{forecast} anyof ['forecast.solar', 'solcast'] or {pvnode_v1}",
      "title": {
        "de": "Dachflächen",
        "default": "Roofs"
      },
      "description": {
        "de": "Bei mehreren unterschiedlich ausgerichteten Dachflächen wird jede einzeln erfasst.",
        "default": "When you have multiple roof surfaces with different orientations, each is configured separately."
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "radiogroup",
          "name": "forecast_roofs",
          "title": {
            "de": "Anzahl Dachflächen mit Solarmodulen",
            "default": "Number of roof surfaces with solar modules"
          },
          "isRequired": true,
          "choices": [
            "1",
            "2",
            {
              "value": "3",
              "visibleIf": "{forecast} anyof ['forecast.solar', 'pvnode']"
            },
            {
              "value": "4",
              "visibleIf": "{forecast} anyof ['forecast.solar', 'pvnode']"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
